# Certified Kubernetes Administrator (CKA): Master Lab Curriculum

Welcome to the hands-on Certified Kubernetes Administrator (CKA) training environment.

The training modules under `~/cka/` are structured into a 17-part linear progression, ordered by increasing
architectural complexity and strict dependency prerequisites.

---

