## Backward-Compatible Navigation Shortcuts

For convenience and muscle memory, all unnumbered legacy directory names are preserved as symlinks:

```bash
# Both of these commands navigate to the identical exercise:
cd ~/cka/07-deployments
cd ~/cka/deployments

# Speed JSONPath:
cd ~/cka/01-jsonpath
cd ~/cka/jsonpath

# User context creation helper:
~/cka/create-user-context.sh
```

