## Terminal Rendering & Tooling
 
To view this guide with formatted styling in the terminal:
 
```bash
glow ~/cka/README.md
```

Available administration and examination utilities on the control plane:

- **`glow`**: Markdown CLI terminal reader (`glow <file.md>`).
- **`k9s`**: Interactive Kubernetes cluster terminal management UI.
- **`kubectl krew`**: Kubectl plugin manager (`kubectl krew search`, `kubectl krew list`).
- **`kubectl cyclonus`**: Kubernetes NetworkPolicy analyzer, linter, and conformance engine.
